  "prefLabel": "Med 300 LICENSURE REQUIREMENTS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Med 300 LICENSURE REQUIREMENTS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #9900, effective 4-12-11, adopted, amended, readopted with amendments, or repealed many rules in Chapters Med 100 through Med 600. In Chapter Med 300, Document #9900 readopted with amendments Med 301.01 through Med 301.03, and Parts Med 302, 303, and 306. Document #9900 also adopted Med 305.03 on administrative licenses, and readopted with amendments and renumbered Med 305.03 as Med 305.04. The source note for Med 305.04 indicates the former rule number Med 305.03, and the document numbers and effective dates apply to the rule under the former number.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/med100-600.html"
